# steps/table-receiver.md §10: a `table:` without `source` at the root of the part
# unit_s7_part_tbl_runtime_refused_part.lm2 (harness Parts) builds a table when the program runs -- a statement
# of that root's procedure, checked as every body is: refused in its own words, in the part (before §10: "a
# statement in a program part is not supported yet").
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
